cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Rocket Launch: an Ammonix control-room agent for a launch vehicle"
type: software
abstract: "A control-room agent for a notional launch vehicle, built from 3,000 simulated launches with the Ammonix platform code. It calls HOLD, ABORT or a flight warning from streaming telemetry and explains every call with a clear-text rule and a measured value; an optional local LLM analyst narrates the calls. All telemetry is synthetic."
